he op’s own spans and needs only one surviving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"boundary to place it. value\/attributes are a deep copy so a GC-purged node"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can be recreated."}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/yorkie_v1_treerestorespan"}}}